@Override
@Transactional(readOnly = true)
public List<PenaltyResponse> getPenalties(String raceId) {
    repository.findRace(raceId)
            .orElseThrow(() -> new NotFoundException("赛事不存在: " + raceId));
    Map<String, Long> servedByPenalty = confirmedCreditsByPenalty(raceId);
    return repository.findPenalties(raceId).stream()
            .map(p -> ResponseMapper.toPenaltyResponse(
                    p, servedByPenalty.getOrDefault(p.penaltyId(), 0L)))
            .toList();
}
```

confirmedCreditsByPenalty(raceId): from findConfirmedExecutionsForRace group by penaltyId sum creditedMs.

wrapPenalties(penalties, servedByPenalty) → List<ResultCalculator.PenaltyView>:

```java
private static List<ResultCalculator.PenaltyView> withServedAmounts(
        List<PenaltyRow> penalties, Map<String, Long> servedByPenalty) {
    return penalties.stream()
            .map(p -> (ResultCalculator.PenaltyView)
                    new PenaltyWithServed(p, servedByPenalty.getOrDefault(p.penaltyId(), 0L)))
            .toList();
}

private record PenaltyWithServed(PenaltyRow row, long servedMs)
        implements ResultCalculator.PenaltyView {
    @Override public String bib() { return row.bib(); }
    @Override public PenaltyType type() { return row.type(); }
    @Override public Long amountMs() { return row.amountMs(); }
    @Override public boolean revoked() { return row.revoked(); }
}
```

