Now the concurrency test. Design:

Test 1: 并发确认同一凭证仅一个成功且只抵扣一次 — seed voucher, 8 threads confirm same voucher distinct requestIds, same expectedVersion. 1 success, 7 ConflictException. servedMs == 6000. Version bumped once.

Test 2: 并发确认不同凭证_抵扣总额不超过处罚量 — penalty 10000, vouchers v1 [0,8000] and v2 [8000,16000] registered. Two threads each confirm one with retry-on-conflict loop (re-read version each attempt). Both eventually succeed; total served == 10000 (v1 8000, v2 2000). Timeout via future.get(30s). Retry loop bounded (e.g., 50 attempts).

Test 3: 并发同requestId确认重放结果一致且只确认一次 — 6 threads same ConfirmExecutionRequest. All succeed with same status/body; servedMs 6000; version +1.

For test 2, retry loop:
```java
private void confirmWithRetry(String voucherId, String reqId) {
    for (int attempt = 0; attempt < 100; attempt++) {
        int version = raceService.getResults(RACE).version();
        try {
            raceService.confirmExecution(RACE, PENALTY, voucherId,
                    new ConfirmExecutionRequest("ref-b", version, reqId));
            return;
        } catch (ConflictException ex) {
            // 版本竞争，重试
        }
    }
    throw new IllegalStateException("确认重试耗尽: " + voucherId);
}
```
Careful: ConflictException could also be "已确认" — but each voucher confirmed once by its own thread only, so conflicts are version races. OK.

Wait — potential deadlock/lock-timeout concerns with H2 row locks: requireOpenRace takes FOR UPDATE on race row; concurrent txs block until lock release; H2 LOCK_TIMEOUT=20000 in test config. Fine.

Test 1 details: threads confirm with expectedVersion=4 (seed: create v1, reg v2, pen v3, registerExecution v4 → current version 4). All 8 use expectedVersion 4. One wins → v5. Others: blocked on race row lock, then see version 5 ≠ 4 → 版本冲突， OR see voucher confirmed → 已确认. Either way ConflictException. Assert success==1, conflicts==7, servedMs==6000, version==5.

Test 3: same request expectedVersion 4, same requestId "req-cf-same". Idempotency: first inserts placeholder, others block on findIdempotencyForUpdate then replay. All get 200 same body. success==6, errors==0, version==5, servedMs==6000.

Now write the file.

